error BYN6002: `undeclared` uses `clock` but does not declare it

  3 │     return Time.now().nanos
    │            ^^^^^^^^^^ uses `clock`
    │
  help: add `clock` to the `uses` clause, or remove the call
    │ 2 │ public i64 undeclared() uses clock {
    │   │                        +++++++++++
